sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Search for events
    %% Stories: 19, 28, 29, 30, 31, 32, 33, 34
    %% Description: A visitor searches for an event by name, narrows the results by venue, genre and price, sorts them by date and opens one.
    actor VI as Visitor
    participant EV as Event
    participant VE as Venue
    participant GE as Genre
    participant TI as Ticket

    VI->>EV: search by name [28]
    Note over VI,EV: search ignores case and punctuation [30]
    EV->>TI: hasAvailableTickets() for each match [19]
    EV-->>VI: matching events with available tickets
    opt narrow down the results [31, 32, 33, 34]
        VI->>EV: filter by venue, genre and price, sort by date
        EV->>VE: matches(venue)
        EV->>GE: matches(genre)
        EV->>TI: inPriceRange(min, max)
        EV-->>VI: filtered events, sorted by date
    end
    VI->>EV: open a search result [29]
    EV-->>VI: event page
